OL,3,GNEWSABike park opens after mum's
OL,4,Atwo-year campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother's dream of creating a space
OL,7,Fwhere her children and others can ride
OL,8,Ftheir bikes has become a reality.
OL,10,FMore than two years after Louise Raine
OL,11,Fcame up with the idea, Richmond Bike
OL,12,FPark welcomed its first visitors when
OL,13,Fit opened at the weekend.
OL,15,FThe project has attracted significant
OL,16,Ffinancial backing from the likes of the
OL,17,FNational Lottery, Sport England, the
OL,18,FYork & North Yorkshire Combined
OL,19,FAuthority, Harmony Energy and
OL,20,FBroadacres Housing Association.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
